select 'Logan', 'vegans-explore', $wr$Wrapped ve-travel: Travel door and 20 listings live, ve-web-reader, Book card (inactive until links), playbook ve-travel locked (Global Tour pilot September 2027), canon canon-ve-travel-standard and canon-ve-web-reader, checkpoint handed off. Waiting on Sean: drafts, Booking.com approval.$wr$, array['wrap','ve-travel','travel','handoff'], 'completed', $wr$https://github.com/lesaruss/vegansexplore-com/blob/main/docs/handoff/2026-11-12-ve-travel.md$wr$
